d in yoga mats  subway said there was no cause for  concern but stopped using the chemical  from then on  well then bon appetit  the following prediction probably  belongs more to the genre tragedy  in the 1993 episode springfield or how i  learned to stop worrying and love  legalized gambling  two magicians perform in springfield  they visually resemble the magician duo  siegfried and roy in the episode the  magicians are attacked by their white  tiger during a show  exactly the same thing happened 10 years  later to the exceptional magician roy  during a performance with his tiger  monticor  according to the magicians roy suffered  a stroke on stage which prompted the  feline predator to simply come to his  rescue whether that was really the  reason  no one knows to this day nevertheless  roy suffered from lasting damage and  hemiplegia until his death in early may  2020  even in the days of the cold war how  springfield oracle succeeded in making a  prediction that would turn out to be  true 27 years later  in russia in the episode itchy and  scratchy and march  a replica of the statue of  michelangelo's david is brought to  springfield the nudity however  outrages some citizens and their demands  to cover it up precisely the same  happened in 2016 when a replica was also  placed in the beautiful city of saint  petersburg  causing the local residents to become  upset and go to the barricades  but as is well known there's no  accounting for taste  matt groening and his team didn't break  the outcome of the 2017 super bowl but  they did foresee dan's performance in  the 2012 episode called  lisa goes gaga lady gaga comes to  springfield for a concert and her stage  performance is spectacular as always  at the end attached to tightrope she  flies across the stage in a metallic  outfit and there are sparks coming out  of her top  entirely exaggerated certainly not after  all  not only the performance but also the  bodysuit at the super bowl performance  five years later  was very reminiscent of the one in the  episode okay  the sparks might be missing but  otherwise the similarity is astounding  warning the following prediction  contains spoilers for the final season  of game of thrones so if you haven't  seen it yet  you should fast forward now many of you  will surely remember the fifth episode  of this season  in the bells queen daenerys was so upset  that she burned down half of king's  landing with her dragon named drogon  inheriting her father's title  as the mad queen what very few noticed  at the time is that in the 2017 simpsons  episode the surfsons almost exactly the  same scene took place  this is because in the episode which is  based on game of thrones a  town is also burned down by a dragon  whether this was another surprising  masterstroke by the simpsons or whether  the game of thrones creators were even  inspired by the animated series  remains a mystery the episode also has  other easter eggs in store for fans the  three-eyed raven is alluded to there are  white walkers and those who watch the  episode in english may  have noticed that marge's brother was  dubbed by none other than jaime  lannister actor  nikolai coster-walder and that he also  has feelings for his twin sister  simulation games have increasingly taken  over computers and smartphones in the  last decade  be sports train track or goat simulator  they come in all types today  on facebook in 2009 the game farmville  conquered the hearts of million users  old and young sat at the computer after  work and school and built their own farm  the simpsons though came up with the  idea 12 years earlier in the episode  bart carney from season 9 you were able  to see a similar game admittedly at the  time it was still called the yardwork  simulator but  working on a farm also has a lot to do  with gardening  so perhaps the zynga development team  borrowed a few things from it  as we found out in our latest simpsons  video our yellow friends are very good  