ately  you don't think it's possible to get an  answer to a beatles fan mail two decades  later  think again in 2013 band colleague paul  mccartney wrote two beatles fans from  essex a belated reply  believe it or not they had sent him fan  mail 50 years ago  here too the simpsons made a good  prediction yet  again however  not all predictions that can be found on  the internet are correct some have been  edited to fit the context take for  example the photo of donald trump with  the saudi arabian king salman bin  abdulaziz and egyptian president abdel  fattah  according to youtube videos and other  sources this was supposedly taken as  early as 2002 15 years before the actual  photo  however it was simply cropped in reality  the image was inserted into the trailer  for the 20th season of the simpsons on  may 26 2017.  it can be seen between seconds five and  six also surrounding the current global  pandemic there are already some theories  circulating  according to some videos and websites  our yellow family is said to have  predicted this catastrophe  however the videos are a compilation of  the episode's marching chains  from the fourth season and the full  monty from the 22nd  which could then be interpreted as a  conspiracy  [Music]  as for 2021 the simpsons has already  made some predictions in the halloween  episode of october 31st  2020 homer forgot to vote during the  presidential election and  once again causes an apocalypse instead  of voting he falls asleep in his hammock  and merely dreams of going to a polling  station  at the end of the day he still thinks it  can't possibly be that bad but when he  wakes up the episode jumps to january  20th 2021  the day of the inauguration of the new  american president homer  sits armed on the roof of his house as  the world ends and even the four  horsemen of the apocalypse fly in the  sky  holding up flags that read treehouse of  horror 31  pestilence famine and war fortunately we  all know that our yellow friends were  wrong on this one and that the world  didn't end on the day of joe biden's  inauguration  let's hope it remains that way and once  again we're through with another episode  hopefully there are some crazy  predictions in this video as well that  got you excited  if you liked the video let us know with  a thumbs up if you get any ideas for a  topic of your own feel free to post it  in the comments below and we might make  an episode out of it  [Music]  you

